{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":735628,\"title\":\"DONG TENG TOWN\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Singer-songwriter Sora has moved to an apartment complex in Dong Teng Town. In the closet, she stumbles upon a large number of old cassette tapes filled with the \\\"inner voice\\\" of a former resident, Tokio.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/QRaEuj7eRZxtizqYM7AkMW3GM5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fvMFVxi1ZMT7SG8SqBeYfL5dYM1.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2020,\"runtime\":61,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Kohei Inoue\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2572111,\"name\":\"Kohei Inoue\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1602225,\"name\":\"Ryo Sato\",\"character\":\"Sora\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mA7UgHpW28QoeJLDxD6kT8kBE92.jpg\"},{\"id\":1871926,\"name\":\"Show Kasamatsu\",\"character\":\"Tokio\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tDASDMyIZQFooUQimqrVCd4rN5I.jpg\"},{\"id\":1952063,\"name\":\"Ai Yamamoto\",\"character\":\"Sora's Sister\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wL19S6GH8Knx6jh7zcuUwiKB5Mw.jpg\"},{\"id\":2751668,\"name\":\"Ryo Anraku\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aPeWhMoQdPb7u15zHJxLoSLpx5t.jpg\"},{\"id\":4010539,\"name\":\"Ganz Morita\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2752513,\"name\":\"Kenta Oikawa\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":130289,\"name\":\"Yuya Matsuura\",\"character\":\"Scenario writer\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ddtLEmejWsxI3gTMFRPjzKAgjty.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":27,\"title\":\"9 Songs\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/91O7z0vo7MiNWd5xD2BoivwbQsb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bybAHw5fenKXRFI4phanPhpljlT.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Matt, a young glaciologist, soars across the vast, silent, icebound immensities of the South Pole as he recalls his love affair with Lisa. They meet at a mobbed rock concert in a vast music hall - London's Brixton Academy. They are in bed at night's end. Together, over a period of several months, they pursue a mutual sexual passion whose inevitable stages unfold in counterpoint to nine live-concert songs.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":936075,\"title\":\"Michael\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dueFqKLvjftnELZaGYwY7xinfaI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ufSwlnECLoUbBjPrFqEQcWBzHwc.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of Michael Jackson, one of the most influential artists the world has ever known, and his life beyond the music. His journey from the discovery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five, to the visionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to become the biggest entertainer in the world, highlighting both his life off-stage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":244786,\"title\":\"Whiplash\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7fn624j5lj3xTme2SgiLCeuedmO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fRGxZuo7jJUWQsVg9PREb98Aclp.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Under the direction of a ruthless instructor, a talented young drummer begins to pursue perfection at any cost, even his humanity.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508442,\"title\":\"Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQaHA74pevnGsxcKGaoZVGWe9TC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":776503,\"title\":\"CODA\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/BzVjmm8l23rPsijLiNLUzuQtyd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v85FlkbMYKa5du1glm0YfYNsL2n.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"As a CODA (Child of Deaf Adults), Ruby is the only hearing person in her deaf family. When the family's fishing business is threatened, Ruby finds herself torn between pursuing her love of music and her fear of abandoning her parents.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":424694,\"title\":\"Bohemian Rhapsody\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lHu1wtNaczFPGFDTrjCSzeLPTKN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcvbs8z0GEXslC1kCT77x19XDeR.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Singer Freddie Mercury, guitarist Brian May, drummer Roger Taylor and bass guitarist John Deacon take the music world by storm when they form the rock 'n' roll band Queen in 1970. Hit songs become instant classics. When Mercury's increasingly wild lifestyle starts to spiral out of control, Queen soon faces its greatest challenge yet – finding a way to keep the band together amid the success and excess.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":332562,\"title\":\"A Star Is Born\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wrFpXMNBRj2PBiN4Z5kix51XaIZ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dDYpjrwh1wNVQk0rEpc9P81wQt4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seasoned musician Jackson Maine discovers — and falls in love with — struggling artist Ally. She has just about given up on her dream to make it big as a singer — until Jack coaxes her into the spotlight. But even as Ally's career takes off, the personal side of their relationship is breaking down, as Jack fights an ongoing battle with his own internal demons.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1102883,\"title\":\"Mother Mary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uVcsN3yoHh7ZcJ6ecj1FJfv7dLa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pRrH098VPYiUtDwKOm2mVXVQZdf.jpg\",\"rating\":5.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Long-buried wounds rise to the surface when iconic pop star Mother Mary reunites with her estranged best friend and former costume designer Sam Anselm on the eve of her comeback performance.\",\"genres\":[\"Music\",\"Thriller\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":65,\"title\":\"8 Mile\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7BmQj8qE1FLuLTf7Xjf9sdIHzoa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jNG7pl0DkN1nzxnbZj4MCGf2VEG.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"For Jimmy Smith, Jr., life is a daily fight just to keep hope alive. Feeding his dreams in Detroit's vibrant music scene, Jimmy wages an extraordinary personal struggle to find his own voice - and earn a place in a world where rhymes rule, legends are born and every moment… is another chance.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":661539,\"title\":\"A Complete Unknown\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/llWl3GtNoXosbvYboelmoT459NM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/otugS74HEHdca4aTCtt8HtXvPYV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"New York, early 1960s. Against the backdrop of a vibrant music scene and tumultuous cultural upheaval, an enigmatic 19-year-old from Minnesota arrives in the West Village with his guitar and revolutionary talent, destined to change the course of American music.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":824,\"title\":\"Moulin Rouge!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2kjM5CUZRIU5yOANUowrbJcRL9L.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vvcLSgiviCIU0J0UcwLqWdU8Iup.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2001,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A celebration of love and creative inspiration takes place in the infamous, gaudy and glamorous Parisian nightclub, at the cusp of the 20th century. A young poet, who is plunged into the heady world of Moulin Rouge, begins a passionate affair with the club's most notorious and beautiful star.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1504358,\"title\":\"Don't Say Good Luck\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dgTKahWonzVLeN8Lm22WR2S7D0A.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yzdMGn8IRHSGuV8AIzw19wkRU2W.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Sophie Birenbaum is ready for the spotlight as the lead in her high school musical—until she's suddenly facing more drama at home than on the stage.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Music\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"R3ZEPTmOoFI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"C4NGShEM6qM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"gttSHs9W9gQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}